  "description": "Ephemeral database test fixtures for EF Core / GM.EntityFramework.Persistence contexts. PostgresDatabaseFixture<TContext> spins up a throwaway PostgreSQL via Testcontainers, applies migrations, and tears the container down on dispose — real relational behaviour in integration tests. InMemoryDatabaseFixture<TContext> is the Docker-free fallback (EF in-memory provider) for fast unit tests. Both are generic over any DbContext (including GenericDbContext-derived), so they pair with GM.EntityFramework.Persistence without coupling to a version. This is the heavy package (Testcontainers + EF) deliberately kept separate so unit-test projects don't inherit Docker/EF. Test-only (DevelopmentDependency).",
